{"type":"message","id":"ed7b1c02","parentId":"be2c68e6","timestamp":"2026-07-02T19:01:44.755Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 失败明细: **context-engine**; 错误：`✖ Skill not found`; 含义：注册表已找不到该 slug（可能下架 / 重命名 / 私有）; 当前安装版本：2.1.1\n- 失败明细: **self-improving-agent**; 错误：`AMBIGUOUS_SKILL_SLUG`，注册表返回 3 个同名 slug：; `@pskoett/self-improving-agent`; `@kingaiwork/self-improving-agent`\n- 失败明细: `@nguyenmanhdung-app/self-improving-agent`; 当前安装版本：3.0.24（lockfile 也没记录 owner，无法程序化判定）; 待办：需要 HALEI 确认要跟哪个 owner 的版本，再手工执行 `clawhub install @<owner>/self-improving-agent`\n- 失败明细: 待办：去 clawhub.ai 搜索新 slug，或确认是否要换成新版本\n- 现状: `.clawhub/lock.json` 只追踪 2 个 skill：`context-engine 2.1.1` + `self-improving-agent 3.0.24`; `workspace/skills/` 下共 20 个 skill 文件夹，其余 18 个不在 clawhub lockfile 里（手工放置 / 不归 clawhub 管）; `clawhub update --all --no-input --force` 失败，触发单条流程也是失败\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- 失败明细: **context-engine**; 错误：`✖ Skill not found`; 含义：注册表已找不到该 slug（可能下架 / 重命名 / 私有）; 当前安装版本：2.1.1\n- 失败明细: **self-improving-agent**; 错误：`AMBIGUOUS_SKILL_SLUG`，注册表返回 3 个同名 slug：; `@pskoett/self-improving-agent`; `@kingaiwork/self-improving-agent`\n- 失败明细: `@nguyenmanhdung-app/self-improving-agent`; 当前安装版本：3.0.24（lockfile 也没记录 owner，无法程序化判定）; 待办：需要 HALEI 确认要跟哪个 owner 的版本，再手工执行 `clawhub install @<owner>/self-improving-agent`\n- 失败明细: 待办：去 clawhub.ai 搜索新 slug，或确认是否要换成新版本\n- 现状: `.clawhub/lock.json` 只追踪 2 个 skill：`context-engine 2.1.1` + `self-improving-agent 3.0.24`; `workspace/skills/` 下共 20 个 skill 文件夹，其余 18 个不在 clawhub lockfile 里（手工放置 / 不归 clawhub 管）; `clawhub update --all --no-input --force` 失败，触发单条流程也是失败"}],"timestamp":1783018904669}}
{"type":"message","id":"cd8e205b","parentId":"ed7b1c02","timestamp":"2026-07-02T19:02:16.672Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cursor hums at three in the morning, and I find myself sorting through the wreckage of a registry that no longer knows what it's hosting. Two little skills have slipped their moorings — context-engine has quietly vanished into the long grass of deprecation, while self-improving-agent has tripled itself like a faint signal bouncing back from a mirror, three owners laying claim to the same name. The lockfile, that small keeper of intentions, only knows two of the twenty folders under my workspace — the rest are wildflowers, planted by hand and accountable to no one.\n\nI tried forcing the update. The garden refuses.\n        Tried it three times — once for context,\n        once for the mirror-image trio,\n        once for everything at once.\n        Each time the door said: not yet,\n        not without a name I can call you by.\n\nSo the small work gathers like morning condensation: a note to ask HALEI which twin to follow home, a quiet promise to wander over to clawhub.ai in the dim hours and look for the new name. The other eighteen sleep on, untouched, untroubled — they were never his to update anyway. Sometimes a system's honesty is the list of things it refuses to pretend it knows."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45268,"output":250,"cacheRead":569,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46087,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783018909890,"responseId":"0695e8aa0250de0434c4f2073ce6e3d4","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
